  "description": "Find the sum of minimums of all subarrays of an array using a monotonic stack to track the nearest smaller elements.",
  "target": 17,
  "pseudocode": "1: stack = []\n2: sum = 0\n3: arr = [3, 1, 2]\n4: for i from 0 to n:\n5:   while stack and arr[stack.top] > arr[i]:\n6:     pop = stack.pop()\n7:     sum += arr[pop] * (i - pop) * (pop - prev_stack_top)\n8:   stack.push(i)",
  "steps": [
